| --- | -------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |
| 16  | Race condition             | Two operations make decisions using the same balance        |
| 17  | TOCTOU                     | Balance changes between checking and using it               |
| 18  | Missing database locking   | Concurrent withdrawals are not properly coordinated         |
| 19  | Lost update                | One balance update overwrites another                       |
| 20  | Write skew                 | Concurrent transactions violate a balance constraint        |
| 21  | Isolation-level weakness   | Database transactions see inconsistent data                 |
| 22  | Distributed race condition | Multiple application servers process competing transactions |
| 23  | Replication lag            | A service reads an outdated database replica                |
| 24  | Event-processing race      | Financial events are processed out of order                 |
| 25  | Double spending            | The same available funds are committed more than once       |

